@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam linetype ortho

[*] --> ConfiguringFilters : openConsole

ConfiguringFilters --> AggregatingData : clickGenerateReport [validDateRange]
AggregatingData --> ReportRendered : querySuccess & kpisCalculated
AggregatingData --> GenerationFailed : noDataFound / dbTimeout

GenerationFailed --> ConfiguringFilters : adjustFilters

ReportRendered --> Exported : exportDocument(format=PDF)
ReportRendered --> Archived : saveSnapshot / autoArchiveWeekly
Exported --> Archived : archiveCopy

Archived --> [*]

@enduml